{"game": "aliens-fireteam-elite", "language": "english", "appid": 1549970, "month": "2023-11", "window": 4, "start_date": 1700697600, "end_date": 1701388799, "month_true_total": 232, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-04 02:22:47 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "152599580", "author": {"steamid": "76561198127387783", "personaname": "elemomentum", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198127387783/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3512, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2445, "last_played": 1702467482, "avatar": "3e3ce1fab12e8b1eff72db059b8e57f7f8835f0c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I really want to like this game. It has lots of potential for those that enjoy tactial co-op shooters.  Lots of damage combos with the different classes, ability modifiers, and weapon attachments to yield hundreds of different results of damage combos from abilities and weapons alike for you and your team. \n\nLike with many online games nowadays, the biggest issue is server related.  In this game, literally EVERY SINGLE game either me or someone else on the team is randomly booted.. literally.. EVERY.. SINGLE.. GAME!  If it is intended to be a team of 3 then the studio should just fix this by adding a fourth member so when someone is inevitably kicked, we still have a full team.  \n\nAfter googling, apparently this server issue goes all the way back to Sept/Oct of 2021; so clearly the production company or maintenance team have no intention or plans of fixing this issue.  So, for neglected bugs and problems that the company refuses to fix, i rate this game super low.  For all the potential this game possesses if it is ever fixed is why I don't completely smear this game's name through the mud right now.", "timestamp_created": 1701372032, "timestamp_updated": 1701372032, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, 